    "title": "Louisville Kings LB Cam Gill named 2026 UFL Defensive Player of the Year - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Michael Heilman ,\n8 hours ago The United Football League (UFL) announced on Wednesday that Louisville linebacker Cam Gill was named the 2026 UFL Defensive Player of the Year presented by NOBULL. The award was selected by a panel of media members, broadcast partners, and coaches and team football personnel from all eight teams. Selections were based on player performances throughout the recently concluded 10-game regular season. Read full article",
